Turbat mein sulata hai tujhe ab tera bhaye<br>
Shayad tujhe ab chain se neend aaye Sakina<br>
<br>
Tu margae behna mujhe kyun mout na aaye<br>
Zanjeer mein jagda huwa majboor hai bhaye<br>
Kaise tujhe seene se wo liptaye Sakina<br>
<br>
