Aur khoon abhi tak tare kanon mein rawan hai<br>
Dunya ne sitam tujh pe bahot dhaye Sakina<br>
<br>
Veraan nazar maa ki hai be sheer ka jhula<br>
Chord aaye hai shismaahe ko jungle mein wo tanha<br>
Kis tarha se dil maa ka sukoon paye sakina<br>
<br>
Kis tarha se puri mein karun teri waseeyat<br>
Kaise bane ab thandi jagah par teri turbat<br>
Madfan hai tera qaid-e-sitam haye Sakina<br>
<br>
Zainab yehi kehti thi Rasheed ashk baha kar<br>
Abbas bhatiji ko zara dekho to aakar<br>
